    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Compare phylogenetic accuracy from single mechanically responsive bones against multi-character morphology and molecular reference trees, stratified by ecological convergence. Reliability is measured by topology error and support.";
