    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Choice of a “mechanically shaped” character may be partly outcome-dependent.", "Fossil taxa lack molecular reference trees.";
